{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團IVE在剛過去的韓國年度音樂盛事《2026 Melon Music Awards》（《MMA 2026》）中，不單憑單曲《BANG BANG》奪下「年度歌曲」大賞，更獲頒「最佳女子團體獎」等共5個獎項，成績亮麗。當中人氣成員、有「人間芭比」之稱的張員瑛，完成頒獎禮後即馬不停蹄，於今日（16日）現身香港迪士尼樂園，擔任聖誕樹亮燈特別嘉賓，吸引大批DIVE（IVE粉絲名）到場應援。當中有粉絲早於上午時段已頂著猛烈太陽排隊入園霸位，務求以最佳角度見到女神，也有身穿校服的學生放學趕來，足見張員瑛在香港的驚人魅力。</p><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078782620143616846203.jpeg/fVldWjZCf1b3A9wAs9YGVn3BkHz0H-1gq8bvFavG7xU\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078780275396608265904.jpeg/uXEy3E5NZp0j8qABl25KIQBZcTWCNoILHQRcUB0EXFA\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078777699962880908524.jpeg/l0liR_P0eKV6gNjYHrJU9eWiEbSSL5tw-9kV0vvZFdI\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078775053225984542890.jpeg/NlLSTa10uoQ2XwA4TyNPbZ90w7xyvpMEADartgA2q7Y\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078772364546048391286.jpeg/vvhjTAQ6Vc0edKDi4xGVHqxbHcac961OubFcCLmxXAg\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078782683058176917325.jpeg/mEfuZ_WAznLDbPC77z-TvyxdMwQsBd1D3bC-Gt2wvho\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078780086652928146975.jpeg/9mH3Fz6V338FQKFhbwaSxZ6PqeLdvU1_Sc8TmUnPE5k\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078777599299584892463.jpeg/ymQW_33H49FGKLA4wU4xQ8hK3aWT3tLYoMW-0qDFvtI\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078774713487360652814.jpeg/S4nll4R0GjOb6sxgxRNxg5pBWxRuQJ-YXbTYF1202Bc\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199078771999641600823641.jpeg/Dch3RG_Xf4tjcFWi-nEaHSn_6eae8RpH9tiOQ_bYjkM\"/><figcaption>（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199075167372840960681945.jpeg/SRcfwDBIwHtELX0Zf3AwZkos7IVqilAtSfPV_Enz1fw\"/><p>冬日公主造型驚艷全場 派心冧爆粉絲</p><p>雖然亮燈儀式於傍晚時分才正式展開，但人群早已迫爆美國小鎮大街兩旁，場面墟冚。至晚上約6時20分，張員瑛在聖誕高飛的陪同下隆重登場，點亮聖誕樹。她化身「冬日公主」，身披白色斗篷，內搭一襲搶眼的紅色露肩蝴蝶結連身短裙，配襯優雅的珍珠頸鏈及耳環，並將一頭長髮盤起，盡顯高貴氣質之餘，更將其173厘米的逆天九 頭身比例及修長美腿表露無遺，猶如童話故事中走出來的公主，仙氣十足。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199075169793085440157984.jpeg/v69pGxKmFgHxmWv_9sR51MV5lBQmUiMWg8KXKoPClyo\"/><p>入鄉隨俗晒廣東話</p><p>台上演出期間，張員瑛站在台下細心觀賞演出，足足企了10多分鐘，現場粉絲見到偶像現身，壓抑一整天的情緒瞬間引爆，紛紛陷入瘋狂狀態，舉起手機瘋狂拍攝兼「失聲式」尖叫，震撼整條美國小鎮大街。面對兩旁熱情應援的DIVE，張員瑛全程保持甜美笑容，不僅頻頻揮手，更識做地大派臉頰愛心、招牌單眼及飛吻等可愛甫士。</p><p>心情大靚的張員瑛，除了與米奇、米妮及聖誕高飛互動外，更入鄉隨俗甫出場便以廣東話向在場傳媒及粉絲打招呼：「大家好，我係員瑛！」她又用英文預祝大家聖誕節快樂，並分享聖誕願望，希望所有人可以同所愛的人一齊開心，全程逗留20分鐘，電力與甜蜜度雙雙爆燈。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199076320382816256904516.jpeg/0BVNRkTQGyGGFB4vuFXu1oVIWJYgAjqI_uDBY_7gwWM\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:37:00.974070+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":814,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:07:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:37.801293+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:37.801293+00:00","content_hash":"95c17c8b883eaae07679e640f31a9719549a1bd09dc70b3c3dafc5976b4e2dc5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}